Patch 6.0.067
Problem:    if_xcmdsrv.c doesn't compile on systems where fd_set isn't defined
	    in the usual header file (e.g., AIX). (Mark Waggoner)
Solution:   Include sys/select.h in if_xcmdsrv.c for systems that have it.
