	    src/proto/if_python.pro, src/proto/if_ruby.pro,
	    src/proto/if_tcl.pro, src/proto/mbyte.pro

Patch 6.0.071
Problem:    The "iris-ansi" builtin termcap isn't very good.
Solution:   Fix the wrong entries. (David Harrison)
