	    Add simplify() to just simplify a file name.  Fix that test49
	    doesn't work if /tmp is a symbolic link.  (Servatius Brandt)
Files:	    runtime/doc/eval.txt, src/eval.c, src/tag.c,
	    src/testdir/test49.vim

