Patch 6.2.151
Problem:    When doing "vim --remote +startinsert file" some commands are
	    inserted as text. (Klaus Bosau)
Solution:   Put all the init commands in one Ex line, not using a <CR>, so
	    that Insert mode isn't started too early.
