	    character and fall back to the non-XIM code. (Neil Bird)
Files:	    src/gui_gtk_x11.c, src/mbyte.c, src/proto/mbyte.pro

Patch 6.2.249
Problem:    ":cnext" moves to the error in the next file, but there is no
