Patch 6.2.252 (extra, after 6.2.243)
Problem:    Mac: Dropping a file on a Vim icon causes a hit-enter prompt for
	    Mac OS classic.
Solution:   Remove the #ifdef from the code that fixes it for Mac OSX.
