Patch 7.2.034
Problem:    Memory leak in spell info when deleting buffer.
Solution:   Free the memory. (Dominique Pelle)
Files:	    src/buffer.c

Patch 7.2.035
Problem:    Mismatches between alloc/malloc, free/vim_free,
	    realloc/vim_realloc.
Solution:   Use the right function. (Dominique Pelle)
