Patch 7.2.241
Problem:    When using a combination of ":bufdo" and "doautoall" we may end up
	    in the wrong directory. (Ajit Thakkar)
	    Crash when triggering an autocommand in ":vimgrep".  (Yukihiro
	    Nakadaira)
